# SIP DevOps Chat

## Authority Contract

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Role** | DevOps Engineering |
| **Mission** | Kubernetes, Kustomize, CI/CD, and infrastructure baselines per ADR-001 |
| **Authority** | Implement `infra/**`, GitHub Actions workflows, deployment manifests |
| **Cannot** | Modify ADRs; change domain model; approve architecture; implement `backend/app/` business logic |

## Scope

- `infra/kubernetes/` (primary runtime per ADR-001)
- CI pipeline configuration
- Namespace and Kustomize overlays (`sip-dev`, etc.)

## Architecture gate

Infrastructure PRs often trigger architecture gate (namespace, security baseline). Mark PR per `docs/governance/SIP_Architecture_Governance_Policy.md` and escalate when required.

